data: {"id": "d75662989b954572-thinking-parallel_evidence-624", "run_id": "d75662989b954572", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "**已确认事实：**\n\n**支持 PendingUnschedulable 的证据：**\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：Phase=Pending，nodeName=None，无 IP，PodScheduled=False。\n2. **调度事件（FailedScheduling）**：default-scheduler 持续报 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`，preemption 也不可行。这是调度失败的确切原因。\n3. **根因定位**：Pod 的 `nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}` 要求节点拥有 label `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`。然而集群中 3 个节点（master, node1, node2）均 Ready，且各自 labels 中 **均不包含** `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 这个 label。因此没有任何节点能匹配该选择器", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789036833727, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

