data: {"id": "d75662989b954572-final", "run_id": "d75662989b954572", "seq": 629, "ts_ms": 1789036849563, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8 处于 Pending 状态，无法调度 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `pod.phase` | `Pending` (fact-3252bdafd0e2) | 确认异常持续状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `default-scheduler` | `FailedScheduling`: 0/3 nodes didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector (fact-592858ae5371) | 直接指出调度失败原因 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `pod.condition` | `PodScheduled`: False, Unschedulable (fact-0faa8d86d995) | 与事件互为印证 |\n| 4 | Metric | `kube_pod_status_phase` | Pending=1, Running=0 (fact-e56703fd9351) | 确认 Pod 当前运行状态 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nK8s 事件 (`#2`) 明确记录了“无法匹配 node affinity/selector”是调度失败的直接原因，且该事件在 15 分钟内连续出现 2 次 (`fact-592858ae5371` 和 `fact-61a7cf3c9892`)，印证了 Pod 处于持续的阻塞状态。Metric (`#4`) 提供了独立维度的状态确认，与 K8s 状态 (`#1`) 完全一致。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了 nodeSelector (aiops.lab/unavailable='true') → 集群所有节点均缺失该 label → 调度器无法找到匹配节点触发 FailedScheduling → Pod 保持 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **调度规则与集群拓扑不匹配**。\n输入中的正式 RCA 指出 `nodeSelector {aiops.lab/unavailable: 'true'}` 导致了匹配失败。当前证据（K8s Event `#2` 中的 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` 以及 K8s Condition `#3`）直接支撑了“调度器无法找到匹配节点”这一结论。\n**证据不足**：当前事实来源未提供具体的 Pod 定义配置（如 YAML），无法验证 `nodeSelector` 字段的具体键值对是否与 RCA 描述完全一致，但现有事实已足以确认调度失败的物理机制。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 49.9s\n├─ 问题定位: 17.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 24.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8: 24.3s (Evidence 16.7s, RCA 7.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 49.936, "metrics": {"run_id": "d75662989b954572", "mttr": {"value": "49.9s", "seconds": 49.9424889087677, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 49942.4889087677, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 46154.6790599823, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 8651.064157485962, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3428.600549697876}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17422.109365463257, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 24347.022771835327, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8151.850461959839, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

